Chromium 156.0.8078.79 -> 156.0.8078.83, for the 156.0.8078.79 release tarball.

156.0.8078.83 is a tag on the 156 branch (refs/branch-heads/8078) that has
no release or source tarball (as of 2026-10-29). It has fixes made after
156.0.8078.79: retaining the SVGImage across
SVGImageForContainer::CreateViewInfo (crbug 575312521), a use-after-free in
the bookmarks side panel, and nested printing. Some are likely security
fixes that later release notes will credit.

Generated from the upstream diff between the tags (chromium/src
refs/tags/156.0.8078.79..156.0.8078.83, 15 commits; no dependency changed
in DEPS), as served by Gitiles, with scripts/chromium-delta.

Left out, as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release
tarball, Android/Mac/Windows-only files, tests, PGO and orderfile pointers.

Added: the tarball's stamp files for the new commit (stamps.py:
build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime}, gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h; commit
fe60b80929194cd5557a585f7aac4aec03139e84, refs/branch-heads/8078@{#1719}).

Checked: applies to the 156.0.8078.79 tarball; chrome/VERSION becomes
156.0.8078.83; every patched source file is byte-identical to its version
at the tag; the 156.0.8078.79 tarball's non-git files are all classified
(tarball-generated.py with generated.conf).

Apply with git apply.

